Which builds carry them
-----------------------

Only builds with the sift-block `public-lists` feature on: the Homebrew Cask and the
Flatpak (D-112). The rules compiled from them for the web engine's content blocker are
treated as an adaptation and ship only in those same builds, under the same terms.

